|---|---|---|---|---|
| `ffn_down` only (baseline) | 86.1% | 81.0% | 31,407 | 0.91h |
| `ffn_down`+`ffn_up`+`ffn_gate` | 91.2% | 88.4% | 30,941 | 1.08h |
| **attention (q/k/v/o) only** | **93.3%** | **92.6%** | 41,437 | 1.74h |
| `ffn_down` only, 20,000 steps | 92.9% | 91.2% | 114,181 | 3.21h |

